    "description": "Just one tap, <b>AI Enhancer</b> turns your old, pixelated, blurry, or damaged pictures into HD quality!\r\n\r\nWith powerful AI, Photo Enhancer can enhance my photos and save memory with this blurry photo fixer & HD photo editor free. The ai photo generator app helps you enhance images and sharpen photos more easily than ever. You can convert your old photos to HD selfies or remove anything in images with unblur picture app.\r\n\r\nWhat you can do with AI Photo Enhancer (<font color=\"#D2001E\"><b>Best Free Photo Editor</b></font>):\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf1f<b>AI Photo Enhancer</b>\r\n- Enhance photo quality, increase the number of pixels and make blurry photo clear.\r\n- HD Portrait, auto recognize faces in selfies or group photos, and enhance facial details with one tap.\r\n- Enhance your beauty, unblur and retouch your selfie, finetune your face with one tap.\r\n- Clear photo background, fix blurry photo and clear spaces, unblur photo and make photo clearer. \r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc87\u200d\u2640\ufe0f<b>Face Editor & Makeup</b>\r\n- Fine tune face shape, width, and other facial features\r\n- Perfect your selfies with Impression filters, try trendy makeup looks effortlessly \ud83e\udd29\r\n- Remove acne, blemish and dark circles , and smooth wrinkles to retouch your face\r\n- Play with hair color changer to try different hair colors easily\r\n- Generate mind-blowing and professional looking AI Portraits & AI headshot.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfa8<b>Restore Old Photos &f Photo Clearer</b>\r\n- Repair damaged and scratched photos to remini precious moments.\r\n- Sharpen photo with eye details and skin texture, sharp AI helps you get remini photo effortlessly.\r\n- Color photo editor, repair colorize your old B&W Black and White photos and old family album photos.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcf7<b>Key Features</b>\r\n- Turn your portrait, selfie, or group picture into HD and color enhance.\r\n- Sharpen and unblur out of focus pictures.\r\n- Upscale pixelated photos into high photo restoration.\r\n- Aesthetic photo editor filters & photo effects for photo retouch, make up photo editor.\r\n- Enhance images and make adjustments by HSL, Brightness, Contrast, Highlight, Shadow, etc.\r\n- Cartoon photo editor, cartoon yourself to generate digital art and toon-me pictures, anime photo editor.\r\n- Make trendy photo collages with 100+ layouts to choose from. \r\n- Large number of Background, Sticker, Filter, Font, and doodle to photo collage.\r\n\r\nThis one click photo enhancer & professional photo editor AI Photo Enhancer can instantly turn your 10 years even 20 years old photos into <b>HD selfies & 4K HD wallpapers</b> as if they were taken with the latest phone, with <b>incredible eye detail</b> and <b>perfect skin texture</b>. Share your artwork on Instagram, Snapchat, WhatsApp, Facebook, TikTok, etc.",
